## 11.6 Getting Started in Cloud
- Choose a cloud provider and follow its learning path (AWS, Azure, or GCP).  
- Practice via free tiers, labs, and sandboxes (e.g., AWS Free Tier, Qwiklabs).  
- Build real-world projects: Deploy a web app, automate backups, create a data pipeline.  
- Engage in open-source contributions and online communities (GitHub, Reddit, Stack Overflow).  

